<title>USA: FREE TO TRADE -- International Paper, Texas.</title>
<headline>FREE TO TRADE -- International Paper, Texas.</headline>
<text>
<p>INTERNATIONAL PAPER</p>
<p>RE: $18,130,000</p>
<p>Effective immediately all syndicate terms and price</p>
<p>restrictions are removed</p>
<p>and the bonds are free to trade.</p>
<p>Morgan Stanley Dean Witter</p>
<p>M.R. Beal &amp; Company</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
